<title>USA: Microlog wins $2.25 mln order from Eckerd.</title>
<headline>Microlog wins $2.25 mln order from Eckerd.</headline>
<dateline>GERMANTOWN, Md. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microlog Corp on Monday said it received an order of $2.25 million from Eckerd Corp.</p>
<p>The order is part of Microlog's implementation of an automated prescription refill system for Eckerd, announced in March 1997.</p>
<p>The system enables physicians to call in prescriptions and patients to order refills by means of a touch-tone telephone, the company said.</p>
